# NeoDev MVP Documents

Controlled documents under the docs root must use YAML front matter accepted by NeoDev scan and validation.

Required front matter:

```yaml
doc_id: DOC-001
title: Document Title
doc_type: prd
product_key: PRODUCT
status: draft
relations:
  target:
    - TARGET-DOC-001
```

Allowed `doc_type` values are `prd`, `prototype`, and `tech-design`.

Allowed `status` values are `draft`, `active`, and `deprecated`.

`relations.target` must be a non-empty list of non-empty strings. Extra fields are allowed, but missing required fields block `doc import` and `doc change register`.

Before import, obtain the active binding with `neodev doc binding list --product-code <product_code> --json`; create it with `neodev doc binding create ... --json` only when missing.

Validate before import or registration:

```bash
python plugins/neodev-rd-knowledge/validate_mvp_docs.py <docs_path>
```
